## PixiJS usage
```ts
const sprite = new Sprite(textures["tile_01_troll"]);
sprite.anchor.set(0.5);
sprite.position.set(tileSize / 2, tileSize / 2);
sprite.width = tileSize;
sprite.height = tileSize;
